From: Eduardo Ruiz <335073+eduarbo@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 15:51:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Bring a video in over its snapshot once its picture is lit

Most videos open on a fade from black, picture and sound. A video that
replaces its snapshot in place (no effect, after a delay) came in over
that black: the capture dimmed to black and the video rose from it.

It now waits until its frames are lit and no longer brightening, at
most three seconds from its first frame, its sound held back until it
shows. The snapshot stays whole under it while it comes in, so the two
crossfade instead of dipping to the background.
